zombie~
a zombie~
A zombie stares mindlessly into space.
~
The zombie appears fragile. Its grey-green flesh looks soft and even its bones
seem brittle. Its eyes are dark, empty pits that somehow seem to see anyway.
The zombie's lips and cheeks have shrunk, revealing large, crooked teeth. Its
hands end in sharp, talonlike nails that bear little resemblance to a normal
person's fingernails. 
~
